WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.200
With react-intl, you write ICU
messages inline and extract

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.161
them into a catalog for translators.

3
00:00:07.561 --> 00:00:11.474
Its FormatJS tooling
serves that workflow well,

4
00:00:11.474 --> 00:00:14.271
from typed arguments
to TMS formatters.

5
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:18.981
General Translation keeps ICU
message syntax and adds translation

6
00:00:18.981 --> 00:00:19.781
generation.

7
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:24.529
Your team moves each
message into useGT,

8
00:00:24.529 --> 00:00:26.362
with its description as context.

9
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:32.247
Then npx gt translate extracts
and translates every catalog

10
00:00:32.247 --> 00:00:33.279
in one command.

11
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.879
Reviewers edit the
results in the Dashboard,

12
00:00:35.879 --> 00:00:38.107
with your Glossary
and Custom Prompts.

13
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:41.203
Your team now ships
French with each release.
